WEBVTT

00:04.350 --> 00:05.480
Did you hear?

00:06.190 --> 00:10.360
Apparently at Mid Jump, sexual content is okay
if it doesn't go on for more than four pages.

00:10.360 --> 00:12.360
What? That sounds obscene.

00:12.360 --> 00:14.240
<i>Right. It is obscene.</i>

00:14.570 --> 00:16.660
The cover for that magazine
is obscene, as well.

00:16.660 --> 00:18.370
<i>Agreed. It is obscene, isn't it?</i>

00:18.910 --> 00:21.250
<i>While we've been focused
on the culture festival,</i>

00:21.250 --> 00:24.330
<i>the rest of the world
has gone into Christmas-mode.</i>

00:24.330 --> 00:27.040
<i>All these couples using Christmas Eve
as a pretext for hooking up...</i>

00:27.040 --> 00:29.340
<i>No vacancies
at any of the love hotels.</i>

00:30.250 --> 00:33.260
At the end of the day,
our world revolves around sex!

00:33.260 --> 00:35.130
Awful! Awful! So obscene!

00:35.130 --> 00:37.550
<i>They all have nothing
but indecent thoughts on their minds!</i>

00:37.550 --> 00:38.300
<i>And then... And then...</i>

00:38.300 --> 00:40.430
<i>Indecent thoughts, huh?</i>
<i>And then... And then...</i>

00:40.430 --> 00:41.350
<i>And then... And then...</i>

00:42.270 --> 00:44.270
<i>What was that kiss, then?</i>

00:44.980 --> 00:46.020
There were...

00:46.480 --> 00:49.520
all these tiny balloons everywhere!

00:49.820 --> 00:52.280
It was gorgeous beyond belief!

00:52.820 --> 00:56.740
And then, President told me
to apply to Stanford!

00:56.740 --> 00:59.070
That is, he ordered me
to join him in the U.S.!

00:59.070 --> 01:00.080
Stanford?

01:00.370 --> 01:02.200
I know! What was he thinking?

01:02.200 --> 01:05.330
But the way he said it with that blush
on his face was just so adorable!

01:06.290 --> 01:08.790
I said yes in spite of myself!

01:12.380 --> 01:14.720
And in spite of myself, I kissed him!

01:16.010 --> 01:18.090
Did you know, Hayasaka?

01:18.390 --> 01:22.600
When you kiss someone you like,
it can't be a regular kiss!

01:24.850 --> 01:26.770
Class is now in session!

01:26.770 --> 01:29.480
You place your lips together like so.

01:29.810 --> 01:32.570
The grown-up way is to slip your tongue in.

01:32.570 --> 01:35.490
Miss Kashiwagi and her boyfriend actually...

01:41.120 --> 01:44.120
So, you didn't know that,
did you, Hayasaka?

01:44.120 --> 01:46.160
How cute.

01:46.160 --> 01:47.500
Idi...

01:47.870 --> 01:52.340
Idiot!

01:52.340 --> 01:53.000
What?

03:25.680 --> 03:29.600
<i>With the culture festival over,
the student council goes back to normal life.</i>

03:30.680 --> 03:33.350
<i>But the scars still
run deep.</i>

03:33.690 --> 03:36.940
<i>And Shirogane's battle
is far from over!</i>

03:37.360 --> 03:39.740
<i>I let her know how I feel!</i>

03:40.400 --> 03:42.110
<i>I even kissed her!</i>

03:42.110 --> 03:44.110
<i>And it was a pretty intense one!</i>

03:44.660 --> 03:45.870
<i>Meaning...</i>

03:46.200 --> 03:48.620
<i>we can be considered
boyfriend and girlfriend now?</i>

03:50.960 --> 03:54.380
<i>But how pure was that kiss, really?</i>

03:54.710 --> 03:57.210
<i>If I'd mismanaged
the distance between us here...</i>

03:57.550 --> 04:01.630
<i>What's this, President? One kiss,
and you're acting like my boyfriend?</i>

04:01.630 --> 04:04.970
<i>That kiss only happened
because we were having a moment.</i>

04:04.970 --> 04:07.680
<i>Surely you don't think
that a kiss makes us lovers now?</i>

04:07.680 --> 04:10.270
<i>That's exactly how a cherry boy's mind would work.</i>

04:10.640 --> 04:12.390
<i>How cute.</i>

04:15.730 --> 04:17.900
President, are you all right?

04:18.480 --> 04:20.530
Uh, yeah, I'm fine.

04:21.860 --> 04:24.530
<i>Today, I'm going to set things straight
with Shinomiya!</i>

04:24.530 --> 04:25.910
<i>No matter what!</i>

04:29.200 --> 04:30.370
<i>Here she comes!</i>

04:43.420 --> 04:44.970
Hey, Shinomiya...

04:44.970 --> 04:46.840
Wait, what?

04:47.140 --> 04:49.470
Doesn't she seem different today?

04:49.760 --> 04:51.470
Now that you mention it,

04:51.470 --> 04:53.480
she does look
more childish than usual.

04:53.980 --> 04:56.350
Oh! Little Kaguya!

04:56.600 --> 04:57.730
- Little Kaguya?
- Little Kaguya?

04:58.020 --> 05:03.530
Little Kaguya! Little Kaguya! Little Kaguya!

05:03.530 --> 05:06.240
I didn't think we'd get to see you this year!

05:06.780 --> 05:10.530
Everyone! How lucky are we
to get to see Little Kaguya?

05:10.530 --> 05:12.750
Wh-What the heck
do you mean by "Little Kaguya"?

05:13.080 --> 05:17.370
Kaguya's personality undergoes slight shifts
depending on her mental state that day.

05:17.370 --> 05:19.250
You're all aware of that, right?

05:19.920 --> 05:22.800
Little Kaguya can only show up if she meets
the most stringent conditions.

05:22.800 --> 05:27.380
60% happy, 40% in denial and, on top
of that, she has to be sleep-deprived.

05:27.380 --> 05:29.680
Every single one of these boxes
needs to be checked.

05:30.100 --> 05:35.310
And only when her psychological balance hits
that sweet spot does this rare Little Kaguya appear!

05:35.310 --> 05:36.890
Rare Kaguya?

05:37.310 --> 05:40.520
Even I've still only seen her three times!

05:40.520 --> 05:41.980
How is this even possible?

05:41.980 --> 05:42.650
<i>That's right!</i>

05:43.070 --> 05:46.070
<i>The conditions had already been met
the previous night!</i>

05:46.490 --> 05:48.110
<i>A grown-up kiss!</i>

05:48.110 --> 05:51.530
<i>In a nutshell,
a dizzying array of kisses exist.</i>

05:51.530 --> 05:54.830
<i>A kiss on the cheek or hand
signifying affection.</i>

05:54.830 --> 05:57.710
<i>A kiss on the lips
indicating a close relationship.</i>

05:57.710 --> 05:58.750
<i>And...</i>

05:59.000 --> 06:00.750
<i>the more meaningful kind of kiss.</i>

06:02.880 --> 06:06.260
Isn't this the way
one normally kisses the one she loves?

06:06.260 --> 06:08.260
It says so in the books I've read.

06:08.260 --> 06:10.220
Even Miss Kashiwagi and her boyfriend...

06:14.270 --> 06:15.470
Miss Kashiwagi?

06:15.470 --> 06:16.270
Yes?

06:16.640 --> 06:17.890
Miss Kashiwagi...

06:17.890 --> 06:20.520
Is that how one typically
goes about kissing another?

06:21.270 --> 06:23.020
Huh? Um... Um—

06:23.900 --> 06:27.440
That was a special kind of kiss
you only give to the person you love!

06:27.440 --> 06:30.360
So whatever you do,
don't kiss anyone else like that, okay?

06:30.360 --> 06:31.660
Understood!

06:31.660 --> 06:33.030
<i>War criminal.</i>

06:33.030 --> 06:36.450
<i>Such disinformation was pumped
into Kaguya, a stranger to girl talk...</i>

06:36.450 --> 06:39.040
<i>And she ends up doing just that.</i>

06:39.420 --> 06:41.710
That was your first-ever kiss?

06:41.710 --> 06:44.040
You aren't in a love scene
in a Hollywood movie!

06:44.040 --> 06:46.300
In other words, it's a regular kiss, right?

06:46.300 --> 06:47.800
Not by a long shot!

06:47.800 --> 06:50.930
You shouldn't be kissing like that
on school grounds!

06:50.930 --> 06:53.800
That's something
you should be doing in bed!

06:54.100 --> 06:55.430
That kind of kiss...

06:55.760 --> 06:57.310
practically amounts to having sex!

06:58.680 --> 06:59.520
Se...

07:01.060 --> 07:02.020
...x?

07:02.020 --> 07:02.860
<i>She managed to say it.</i>

07:03.440 --> 07:04.440
Wait!

07:04.440 --> 07:06.440
What do you mean by "sex"?

07:07.940 --> 07:10.360
All I did was insert my tongue
into his oral cavity!

07:10.360 --> 07:12.950
That can't possibly be sex!

07:14.830 --> 07:16.490
It's totally sex.

07:16.490 --> 07:19.120
It's something you do
in the process of having sex.

07:19.120 --> 07:21.250
Stop repeating the word "sex"!

07:21.250 --> 07:23.710
You've been repeating it
yourself, Lady Kaguya!

07:24.540 --> 07:26.590
Well, Christmas is around the corner.

07:26.590 --> 07:28.010
Since you've gotten this far already,

07:28.010 --> 07:30.340
it will be a breeze to take it
to the next level and have sex.

07:30.340 --> 07:31.550
Good for you.

07:31.550 --> 07:34.220
Wait! Why on earth would you go there?

07:34.510 --> 07:39.350
Don't people normally wait at least a month or two
after their first kiss to engage in that sort of thing?

07:39.350 --> 07:42.100
It's a different story if you've already
gone that far with your first kiss!

07:43.650 --> 07:45.900
<i>I'm just not getting through to you.</i>

07:45.900 --> 07:49.320
<i>This is why children like you
who've never been kissed...</i>

07:49.650 --> 07:53.110
You're thinking of something
unbelievably infuriating right now, aren't you?

07:53.740 --> 07:55.370
I'm getting nowhere with this!

07:55.370 --> 07:58.120
Let me ask someone with experience
about what to actually expect!

08:03.000 --> 08:06.040
Hello? Kaguya? What a surprise!

08:06.040 --> 08:07.250
Is something wrong?

08:07.250 --> 08:09.630
<i>I'd like to ask you something,
Miss Kashiwagi.</i>

08:10.050 --> 08:11.840
What is it? Ask me anything!

08:11.840 --> 08:13.130
<i>Well, you see...</i>

08:13.430 --> 08:16.260
About how long did you wait
to have sex after your first kiss?

08:18.140 --> 08:20.930
I-I'll have you know, Tsubasa and I
have never done anything so indec—

08:20.930 --> 08:22.390
Please don't ridicule me!

08:22.390 --> 08:25.060
I couldn't be more serious than I am now!

08:25.650 --> 08:26.560
What?

08:26.900 --> 08:28.690
This is a serious conversation?

08:34.110 --> 08:36.030
After that first kiss,

08:36.570 --> 08:37.950
maybe two months.

08:37.950 --> 08:41.080
Of course! You'd wait
at least that long, right?

08:41.500 --> 08:43.210
Then, how long after a grown-up kiss?

08:46.880 --> 08:48.210
About 40 seconds.

08:50.840 --> 08:52.590
Seconds?

08:52.920 --> 08:55.970
Are you finally starting
to see the light, Lady Kaguya?

08:56.260 --> 08:57.720
Just acknowledge it!

08:57.720 --> 08:59.970
That because your first kiss was a deep dive,

08:59.970 --> 09:04.270
chances are that President sees you
as a super-nympho lust monster!

09:04.270 --> 09:06.350
A super-nympho lust monster?

09:11.440 --> 09:12.360
<i>How...</i>

09:13.190 --> 09:16.320
<i>How can I possibly look him
in the eye tomorrow?</i>

09:16.320 --> 09:18.910
<i>In an abrupt about-face
after that Ultra Romantic night,</i>

09:18.910 --> 09:22.660
<i>the point that Hayasaka brought up
has caused her to spend a night of agony!</i>

09:22.660 --> 09:24.120
<i>And sleep-deprivation ensues!</i>

09:24.500 --> 09:27.790
<i>Kaguya's brain plunges even further
into the depths of malfunction!</i>

09:27.790 --> 09:31.500
<i>Resulting in two straight days of zero IQ!</i>

09:32.050 --> 09:34.010
<i>Intellectually, it's Black Monday!</i>

09:34.010 --> 09:34.920
<i>And...</i>

09:34.920 --> 09:36.260
<i>Rare Kaguya?</i>

09:36.260 --> 09:37.380
<i>Descent.</i>

09:37.640 --> 09:39.890
This is a hundred times better
than her being scary, so I accept it!

09:39.890 --> 09:41.510
Whaaaaat?

09:41.930 --> 09:46.270
<i>Damn! Today of all days,
I really wanted to talk to Shinomiya!</i>

09:46.690 --> 09:49.860
<i>In this state,
I can't even get through to her!</i>

09:50.560 --> 09:51.820
<i>This is bad!</i>

09:52.530 --> 09:56.280
Wh-Wh-What is it, Shinomiya?

09:56.650 --> 09:58.910
Pwesident, good morning!

09:59.240 --> 10:01.160
<i>Actually, maybe it's perfect.</i>

10:01.450 --> 10:03.410
<i>Who is this adorable creature?</i>

10:03.410 --> 10:06.790
<i>Needless to say,
she's in a super-deformed state.</i>

10:07.290 --> 10:09.040
<i>This is how she appears to everyone.</i>

10:09.880 --> 10:12.000
Tell me, how old are you, Little Kaguya?

10:12.000 --> 10:14.800
Um... Um... Seventeen?

10:14.800 --> 10:17.550
Seventeen, huh? What a sweetheart!

10:17.970 --> 10:22.100
Did you know? If you're 17,
then next year, you'll be an adult!

10:22.430 --> 10:26.810
It's not a good look to take advantage of someone
when they're vulnerable, Ishigami. So cut it out.

10:26.810 --> 10:28.190
Oh!

10:28.190 --> 10:31.060
So cuddly and fluffy!
I want to display you at my house!

10:35.610 --> 10:36.820
Ouch!

10:38.280 --> 10:40.240
Hey! You can't hit people, you bad girl!

10:40.240 --> 10:43.660
We just caught a glimpse
of Shinomiya's inner psyche, right?

10:44.030 --> 10:46.000
Can't you see she doesn't like that?

10:46.000 --> 10:47.660
Just let her go, okay?

10:47.660 --> 10:49.290
Oh, she's totally fine!

10:49.870 --> 10:52.750
Little Kaguya loves me the best, don't you?

10:52.750 --> 10:55.300
Go on, show us
who your favorites are in order!

10:56.840 --> 10:57.720
Number one.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.340
Huh?

10:58.340 --> 10:59.050
Number two.

10:59.050 --> 10:59.800
Huh?

11:00.760 --> 11:02.050
Number three.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.970
What are you talking about?

11:03.970 --> 11:07.930
Don't ask me, but I think
she just went with the flow there.

11:09.310 --> 11:09.980
Here.

11:09.980 --> 11:10.690
What?

11:10.690 --> 11:12.100
You're giving me a snack?

11:12.100 --> 11:13.310
Thanks!

11:13.650 --> 11:14.400
Here.

11:14.690 --> 11:15.820
Hey, thanks!

11:16.320 --> 11:17.070
Here.

11:17.070 --> 11:18.320
You're giving me one, too?

11:19.360 --> 11:20.240
Oh...

11:24.070 --> 11:25.080
Sniff!

11:25.080 --> 11:26.660
I'll run out and get some candy!

11:26.660 --> 11:28.580
We're going at top speed,
so hang on, okay?

11:35.670 --> 11:38.710
Listen, Shinomiya, about yesterday...

11:39.340 --> 11:40.300
Pwesident...

11:40.300 --> 11:41.800
You're breathing!

11:41.800 --> 11:42.930
We're the same!

11:43.340 --> 11:46.680
<i>It's no good. We can't talk like this.</i>

11:46.680 --> 11:50.810
<i>Right now, it seems like Shinomiya's brain
is the size of an orange.</i>

11:51.270 --> 11:53.850
<i>She's probably seeing a different world than I am.</i>

11:54.610 --> 11:57.070
<i>Come to think of it, I've heard
that if the gap between your IQ is 20 or so,</i>

11:57.070 --> 12:00.190
<i>there's no way
you can hold a conversation.</i>

12:01.280 --> 12:02.950
<i>In that case...</i>

12:03.660 --> 12:04.780
Chinomiya!

12:06.330 --> 12:07.660
Pwesident?

12:07.660 --> 12:09.580
Chinomiya, let's talk!

12:09.870 --> 12:11.460
Okay! Let's!

12:11.710 --> 12:13.290
What should we talk about?

12:13.290 --> 12:14.460
Anything you want!

12:14.710 --> 12:16.170
Chinomiya! Chinomiya!

12:16.170 --> 12:17.340
Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:17.340 --> 12:19.090
Chinomiya!

12:19.090 --> 12:20.090
Pwesident! Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:20.090 --> 12:24.720
<i>They're holding a conversation,
and it's scarily devoid of substance.</i>
Pwesident! Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:28.140 --> 12:29.600
I'm sorry I'm late—

12:29.600 --> 12:31.180
Chinomiya! Chinomiya!

12:31.180 --> 12:32.480
Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:32.480 --> 12:33.890
Chinomiya! Chinomiya!

12:33.890 --> 12:35.100
Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:35.100 --> 12:36.610
Chinomiya! Chinomiya!

12:36.610 --> 12:38.110
Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:38.110 --> 12:40.990
Chinomiya! Chinomiya! Chinomiya! Chinomiya!

12:40.990 --> 12:43.860
Pwesident! Pwesident! Pwesident! Pwesident!

12:45.200 --> 12:47.910
<i>Aren't you both too old
to be doing whatever this is?</i>

12:47.910 --> 12:51.540
<i>Super-deformed is just super-deformed.</i>

12:52.000 --> 12:54.250
<i>Three days until Christmas Eve!</i>

12:54.250 --> 12:56.750
<i>Having shared a grown-up kiss,</i>

12:56.750 --> 13:01.380
<i>these two are about to see the curtain go up
on this year's final romantic battle of minds!</i>

13:03.970 --> 13:06.970
<i>For Hayasaka, it was the morning from hell.</i>

13:09.180 --> 13:11.220
Little Kaguya's fast asleep, huh?

13:11.220 --> 13:12.560
I'm not surprised.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.600
The culture festival must've worn her out.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.480
Let's let her get some real rest.

13:16.770 --> 13:20.110
Hey, almost forgot.
I brought this week's Mid Jump.

13:20.110 --> 13:21.230
Great! Thank you!

13:22.280 --> 13:24.990
That's lewd material you have there.
I'm confiscating it.

13:24.990 --> 13:26.990
Where'd you come from, Iino?

13:28.200 --> 13:29.240
Look, Iino...

13:29.240 --> 13:32.080
can you at least wait
until President finishes it?

13:32.080 --> 13:34.370
Negative! The rules are the rules!

13:34.370 --> 13:36.620
You only have yourself to blame
for bringing in contraband!

13:36.620 --> 13:38.330
It's the same old, same old, huh?

13:38.330 --> 13:40.880
Makes you wonder if it's going to be
like this until we graduate.

13:41.210 --> 13:43.380
We're going to be
at each other's throats until the end.

13:43.710 --> 13:45.630
I have no idea why...

13:45.630 --> 13:49.350
but whenever you do something to me,
I can't rest until I get back at you.

13:49.350 --> 13:50.220
What?

13:52.810 --> 13:56.390
If you promise never to bring
anything like this again,

13:56.390 --> 13:58.150
I'll let you have your book back.

13:58.520 --> 14:02.400
Just keep your word on that,
and the odds of us getting along might be...

14:03.190 --> 14:04.280
more than...

14:04.530 --> 14:05.280
zero.

14:11.830 --> 14:15.540
That's not going to happen.
I'm so going to bring another one next week.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.420
How do you not see
that it's your own fault?

14:20.830 --> 14:22.920
Are you stupid? Are you?
Seriously? What's going on here?

14:22.920 --> 14:24.920
Ouch! I'll bring it, no matter what!
An old-school brawl?

14:24.920 --> 14:26.670
Ts-Tsubame!

14:27.220 --> 14:28.630
Don't mind us, please.
We're always like this.

14:28.630 --> 14:29.970
<i>After I made such a huge concession...</i>
Don't mind us, please.
We're always like this.

14:29.970 --> 14:31.430
Well, if you say so.
<i>After I made such a huge concession...</i>

14:31.800 --> 14:35.140
Oh, right! There's something
I wanted to ask you, Yu.

14:35.140 --> 14:36.180
What is it?

14:36.930 --> 14:40.190
Do you think you'll be free
on Christmas Eve?

14:41.940 --> 14:43.940
<i>What is this? No way!</i>

14:43.940 --> 14:48.450
U-Um, if you don't feel like it,
you can totally say no, okay?

14:48.450 --> 14:50.660
Wanna come over that day?

14:50.660 --> 14:51.490
I'll be there!

14:51.490 --> 14:52.200
Yay!

14:52.530 --> 14:55.700
<i>Whoa, Tsubame's house? On Christmas?</i>

14:55.700 --> 14:57.960
<i>In Tsubame's room?</i>

14:59.250 --> 15:01.960
That's beyond perverted!

15:02.540 --> 15:06.090
Oh! It's not like that!
I was planning to invite you, too, Iino!

15:06.090 --> 15:07.130
For a threesome?

15:07.130 --> 15:10.630
No! I'll be inviting a lot of people!
I'm going to throw a party!

15:10.630 --> 15:11.760
It's an orgy!

15:11.760 --> 15:13.760
Shut up, you clueless
Disciplinary Committee member!

15:13.760 --> 15:16.350
How do you not get that she's talking
about a Christmas party?

15:16.810 --> 15:18.600
O-O-Oh!

15:18.600 --> 15:22.400
Oh, sorry. That just never crossed
my mind when I said it.

15:23.150 --> 15:27.110
<i>Hey, if Iino wasn't around,
I totally would've gotten the wrong idea, too.</i>

15:27.480 --> 15:30.360
I'm inviting the Cheerleading Squad
and the Culture Festival Committee.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.610
Rei says she'll be coming, too!

15:31.610 --> 15:32.620
Rei?

15:32.620 --> 15:33.950
Tsubame!

15:34.580 --> 15:36.990
All right, I'm in the middle
of an errand here...

15:37.370 --> 15:39.500
so let me know if you're coming!

15:40.080 --> 15:42.000
Hey, Ishigami...

15:43.290 --> 15:45.540
Are you free on Christmas Eve?

15:45.540 --> 15:47.710
Wanna come over that day?

15:47.710 --> 15:50.130
Oh, are you having a Christmas party?

15:50.130 --> 15:51.760
I'm surprised you made the connection.

15:52.050 --> 15:56.140
So, let's have a Christmas party for everyone in the
student council! I'll provide my home as the venue!

15:56.430 --> 15:58.680
You'll come, too, won't you, Kaguya?

15:59.310 --> 16:00.430
That's a yes!

16:00.430 --> 16:02.140
Isn't she just moaning in her sleep?

16:02.480 --> 16:06.270
You won't have to spend another lonely Eve
all by yourself this year, Ishigami!

16:06.570 --> 16:08.190
Thanks to Chika,
your brilliant event planner—

16:08.190 --> 16:09.440
Hey, sorry, Senpai...
Thanks to Chika,
your brilliant event planner—

16:09.440 --> 16:10.030
Hey, sorry, Senpai...

16:10.690 --> 16:12.110
but on Christmas Eve,

16:12.400 --> 16:14.280
I've got plans.

16:16.120 --> 16:19.290
It's kind of a shame that your howls of laughter
will go to waste, but it's the truth.

16:19.620 --> 16:23.460
It really is true.
Tsubame just invited Ishigami and me.

16:23.460 --> 16:24.290
What?

16:24.880 --> 16:29.340
You can't possibly turn down an invitation
from Tsubame, can you, Ishigami?

16:29.340 --> 16:31.550
Huh? Why couldn't I, if it's her?

16:31.550 --> 16:35.800
Everyone here is aware
that you have a crush on Tsubame.

16:35.800 --> 16:36.510
Yeah.

16:36.510 --> 16:37.220
Well, yes.

16:37.220 --> 16:39.010
No way!

16:40.310 --> 16:41.560
Since when?

16:41.560 --> 16:42.810
Maybe around the sports festival?

16:42.810 --> 16:44.810
No way!

16:45.770 --> 16:46.440
So...

16:46.860 --> 16:48.690
which party are you going to, Iino?

16:48.690 --> 16:53.700
Well, I know you think
I'd be a thorn in your side. So I guess I'll...

16:54.030 --> 16:56.320
Huh? I don't think that.

16:59.080 --> 17:01.330
Is... that right?

17:01.660 --> 17:02.580
Huh?

17:13.340 --> 17:17.470
I have to give him my answer
three months from now, huh?

17:28.270 --> 17:33.490
If no one's claimed it
in three months, huh?

17:35.360 --> 17:37.240
Not that I really want it.

17:38.990 --> 17:40.490
<i>Christmas, huh?</i>

17:40.830 --> 17:43.500
<i>I wonder what Shinomiya's going to do.</i>

17:52.840 --> 17:57.930
<i>The second battle of minds
inside her own brain and the trial begin!</i>

18:06.350 --> 18:10.110
Not only did the defendant steal a kiss
from Miyuki Shirogane without warning,

18:10.110 --> 18:12.070
but she even inserted her tongue,
of all things.

18:12.570 --> 18:15.780
She is therefore charged with the crime proscribed
in article 174 of our personal penal code...

18:15.780 --> 18:17.740
The Grown-Up Kiss Offensive.

18:17.740 --> 18:20.700
In addition, the defendant is deemed
a flight risk who may flee the country.

18:20.700 --> 18:25.330
Therefore, the prosecution seeks
the death penalty for the defendant.

18:25.330 --> 18:26.210
Death penalty?

18:26.830 --> 18:27.710
No objections.

18:27.710 --> 18:29.580
My own lawyer won't even defend me?

18:29.580 --> 18:31.290
<i>Pwesident is in the student council room...
Wow, it's perfect!</i>

18:31.290 --> 18:33.340
Uttering gibberish
in front of President...
<i>Pwesident is in the student council room...
Wow, it's perfect!</i>

18:33.340 --> 18:34.420
<i>Number one...</i>

18:34.420 --> 18:36.340
S-Saying he was your number one!

18:36.760 --> 18:37.680
I don't remember.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.840
Well, what a convenient mind you have!

18:40.180 --> 18:41.680
Well, why is it such a big deal?

18:41.680 --> 18:45.180
President used all those balloons
to let me know how he feels!

18:45.180 --> 18:46.680
What's wrong with that?

18:46.680 --> 18:49.480
W-Well, you do have a point, but—

18:49.480 --> 18:50.770
How ludicrous.

18:50.770 --> 18:54.110
Why are you letting
mere balloons rattle you?

18:55.480 --> 18:57.360
You're not looking like yourself, either!

18:57.650 --> 19:00.360
My internal breakers broke, too.

19:00.360 --> 19:01.070
All right.

19:02.530 --> 19:04.200
Playtime is over.

19:04.200 --> 19:08.000
You've been summoned today so that
we can decide what to do going forward.

19:08.000 --> 19:11.080
This is a crucial decision
that will determine our future.

19:11.500 --> 19:13.170
There are three issues under discussion.

19:13.170 --> 19:15.210
Let us resolve them one by one.

19:15.550 --> 19:16.210
First of all...

19:16.210 --> 19:18.670
our relationship with President.

19:18.670 --> 19:21.970
Come on, we've got to be lovers now!
I mean, we've kissed!

19:21.970 --> 19:23.180
R-Right, we are, aren't we?

19:23.180 --> 19:24.720
Don't be ridiculous.

19:24.720 --> 19:29.310
If kissing makes you lovers,
then sex workers would be lovers with everyone.

19:29.310 --> 19:30.730
I have to agree.

19:31.060 --> 19:36.070
Although our feelings are undeniably mutual,
we've never been vocal about them.

19:36.070 --> 19:39.740
If we're to take it to the next level,
we should say so directly.

19:39.740 --> 19:43.990
Then regarding Number 1,
our conclusion must be...

19:46.950 --> 19:49.370
Next, let's discuss studying abroad!

19:49.370 --> 19:52.370
Well, President did say
it was a once-in-a-lifetime wish!

19:52.370 --> 19:53.380
I'm so going!

19:53.380 --> 19:54.250
Yes.

19:56.000 --> 19:56.300
Are you serious?

19:56.300 --> 19:57.300
Huuuh?
Are you serious?

19:57.300 --> 19:57.880
Huuuh?

19:58.170 --> 20:01.760
You don't seriously believe
you'll be allowed to do such a thing, do you?

20:02.130 --> 20:04.010
How do you plan to talk Father into it?

20:04.010 --> 20:05.510
Well...

20:05.760 --> 20:09.640
Consider it a blessing that you've been able
to distance yourself from him.

20:09.980 --> 20:14.020
You must refrain at all costs from doing anything
that would awaken the sleeping tiger.

20:14.310 --> 20:16.270
But I already told him I'd go.

20:16.570 --> 20:18.530
Keeping your promises, no matter what.

20:18.530 --> 20:21.950
You need something in your life
that you can have absolute faith in.

20:21.950 --> 20:23.910
Isn't that the policy you live by?

20:24.410 --> 20:26.910
Do whatever you want. However...

20:27.910 --> 20:32.790
when you fail, it might be
the last time I ever see your face.

20:38.920 --> 20:43.550
And finally, regarding that grown-up kiss...

20:43.550 --> 20:45.800
what are we going to do about it?

20:46.300 --> 20:48.180
Seriously, what are we going to do? Well?

20:48.640 --> 20:52.180
President might be thinking
that I'm a super-nympho lust monster!

20:52.180 --> 20:54.190
I mean it, what are we going to do?

20:54.190 --> 20:56.060
All you have to do is explain yourself.

20:56.060 --> 20:58.020
That you just misread the situation.

20:58.020 --> 20:59.690
But that would be embarrassing!

21:00.030 --> 21:03.570
I think it would be better
to take the stance of a grown-up woman!

21:03.570 --> 21:05.070
What a ludicrous conversation.

21:05.070 --> 21:07.950
That's why you never should've kissed him.

21:07.950 --> 21:11.000
In the first place, a kiss is something
that the man should seek.

21:11.000 --> 21:13.830
A woman going for a kiss...
How disgraceful is that!

21:13.830 --> 21:15.620
I think you're being sexist!

21:15.620 --> 21:19.250
She's right! Who decided
that a woman can't kiss first?

21:19.250 --> 21:21.960
You have no clue, do you?

21:22.380 --> 21:25.470
I'd rather have a kiss stolen from me,
not the other way around!

21:25.470 --> 21:26.470
Huh?

21:26.470 --> 21:28.260
What? But why?

21:28.260 --> 21:30.850
Because it would make my heart
pound harder that way!

21:30.850 --> 21:33.230
We all have different fetishes!

21:33.230 --> 21:36.350
Kissing impulsively...
We're not beasts in the wild!

21:36.350 --> 21:39.230
Would it kill you to learn a little restraint?

21:39.230 --> 21:42.230
It's only natural to want
to kiss someone you're in love with!

21:42.230 --> 21:45.490
That's right! If you really love someone,
there's just no holding back!

21:45.490 --> 21:49.740
You can say stuff like that
because you're not in love with President, Ice!

21:52.120 --> 21:53.620
Me...

21:54.080 --> 21:55.920
not in love with...

21:56.250 --> 21:58.000
Miyuki Shirogane?

21:58.920 --> 22:01.920
You happy-go-lucky insurgents...

22:02.250 --> 22:07.010
You can't see the forest for the trees
because you put your own feelings first!

22:07.430 --> 22:09.260
You have no idea how much I've held back!

22:09.600 --> 22:12.390
How I've continued to hold back all this time!

22:12.770 --> 22:15.810
It was none other than I
who first fell in love with Miyuki Shirogane!

22:15.810 --> 22:17.650
More than you two ever have!

22:17.650 --> 22:22.570
I'm also the one who's the most serious
about my future with him!

22:22.570 --> 22:25.990
Here I am, racking my brain
to find a way to make him mine,

22:25.990 --> 22:27.990
yet you both keep doing as you please!

22:27.990 --> 22:31.280
How arrogant of you,
you Kaguya-come-latelys!

22:31.280 --> 22:32.620
Hey, hold up.

22:32.620 --> 22:35.160
Don't argue with yourself. It's just sad.

22:35.160 --> 22:38.710
Right! In the first place, it doesn't matter
who fell in love with him first!

22:38.710 --> 22:41.790
I mean, aren't you even happy
that President kissed you?

22:41.790 --> 22:44.380
Oh, would you shut up?

22:45.670 --> 22:49.640
It's like your brains
are in la-la land, you morons!

22:50.640 --> 22:53.060
Don't you dare lecture me!

22:53.680 --> 22:57.940
I've been longing all this time
for President to kiss me!

22:58.690 --> 23:00.440
So, what were you thinking?

23:00.940 --> 23:02.440
Go die and rot in hell!

23:02.440 --> 23:04.940
For once in your lives,
consider my feelings, too!

23:05.570 --> 23:07.610
Oh, this isn't good.

23:16.500 --> 23:19.830
<i>Are you sure
you want to conceal the real you?</i>

23:31.340 --> 23:32.970
Are you awake, Shinomiya?

23:33.300 --> 23:34.390
Morning.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.520
Yes.

23:40.900 --> 23:43.480
It seems I've been fast asleep for a while.

23:43.810 --> 23:44.730
Huh?

23:45.230 --> 23:47.740
Good morning, Shirogane.

23:50.240 --> 23:53.200
I'd appreciate a cup of coffee, please.
